OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786898895
OL,3,CMagnitude 7.7 earthquake strikes
OL,4,CIndonesia's coast, killing at least 5
OL,6,FA powerful magnitude 7.7 earthquake
OL,7,Fstruck off the coast of Indonesia
OL,8,Fearly on Saturday, collapsing
OL,9,Fbuildings and homes and killing at
OL,10,Fleast five people.
OL,12,FAuthorities issued a tsunami warning
OL,13,Fand urged coastal residents to move to
OL,14,Fhigher ground, but later lifted the
OL,15,Fwarning after Indonesia's Meteorology,
OL,16,FClimatology and Geophysics Agency said
OL,17,Fmonitoring showed no significant sea-
OL,18,Flevel changes that posed a threat to
OL,19,Fcoastal communities.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
