OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786898895
OL,3,CMagnitude 7.7 earthquake strikes
OL,4,CIndonesia's coast, killing at least 5
OL,6,FThe US Geological Survey said the
OL,7,Fquake struck Indonesia's Flores region
OL,8,Fat a depth of 10 kilometres at 5.58am
OL,9,Flocal time.
OL,11,FIts epicentre was 42 miles north-
OL,12,Fnorthwest of the city of Ende in East
OL,13,FNusa Tenggara province.
OL,15,FThe initial quake was followed by
OL,16,Fseveral aftershocks.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
