PN,31403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786898895
OL,3,CMagnitude 7.7 earthquake strikes
OL,4,CIndonesia's coast, killing at least 5
OL,6,FEast Nusa Tenggara police chief Rudi
OL,7,FDarmoko said initial reports indicated
OL,8,Ftwo deaths in Sikka Regency and three
OL,9,Fin Manggarai Regency after the
OL,10,Fearthquake caused severe damage and
OL,11,Fcollapsed buildings.
OL,13,FHe said power outages in cities and
OL,14,Fvillages had hampered the flow of
OL,15,Finformation and complicated search and
OL,16,Frescue efforts.
OL,18,F"We are continuing to collect reports
OL,19,Fof damages and casualties, but there
OL,20,Fare communication disruptions,"
OL,21,FDarmoko said.
OL,26,@zD@AOU|D@_O]
