OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786898895
OL,3,CMagnitude 7.7 earthquake strikes
OL,4,CIndonesia's coast, killing at least 5
OL,6,FFootage on local television showed
OL,7,Fpatients being evacuated from several
OL,8,Fhospitals as a precaution after the
OL,9,Fquake.
OL,11,FHospital staff moved equipment
OL,12,Foutdoors, including beds, IV stands,
OL,13,Fand oxygen cylinders, and set up
OL,14,Ftemporary treatment areas.
OL,16,FStudents at St Peter Major Seminary in
OL,17,FSikka fled in panic while attending
OL,18,Fmorning Mass after the roof of an
OL,19,Fassembly hall collapsed, according to
OL,20,Fthe seminary's rector, the Reverend
OL,21,FGuidelbertus Tanga.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
