PN,31405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786898895
OL,3,CMagnitude 7.7 earthquake strikes
OL,4,CIndonesia's coast, killing at least 5
OL,6,F"Our students and nuns ran out in
OL,7,Fpanic beneath a collapsing roof,"
OL,8,FTanga said. "At least one priest
OL,9,Fsuffered a broken leg after jumping
OL,10,Ffrom the second floor of a building
OL,11,Fduring the quake."
