OL,3,CMagnitude 7.7 earthquake strikes
OL,4,CIndonesia's coast, killing at least 5
OL,6,FIndonesia, a vast archipelago of more
OL,7,Fthan 17,000 islands, is prone to
OL,8,Fearthquakes and volcanic activity
OL,9,Fbecause of its location on the "Ring
OL,10,Fof Fire", an arc of volcanoes and
OL,11,Ffault lines around the Pacific Basin.
OL,13,FIn 2010, a 10-foot wave struck the
OL,14,FMentawai Islands off the western coast
OL,15,Fof Sumatra, just minutes after a
OL,16,Fpowerful offshore earthquake. More
OL,17,Fthan 400 people were killed, and
OL,18,Fhundreds of homes were destroyed.
