OL,3,CMagnitude 7.7 earthquake strikes
OL,4,CIndonesia's coast, killing at least 5
OL,6,FIn December 2004, a massive magnitude
OL,7,F9.1 earthquake off Sumatra triggered a
OL,8,Ftsunami that killed 230,000 people in
OL,9,Fa dozen countries.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
